    "question": {
        "text": "§\n\nOther than osteoporosis, what can biphosphonates be used to treat?",
        "imageIds": []
    },
    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nOther than osteoporosis, what can biphosphonates be used to treat?\n\n(1) Hypercalcemia\n(2) Paget's Disease\n\n(Note: Calcitonin has similar indications, but is second line)\n\n[Image: 0882d6df9aecc5a404f03100ca28f0a4ac4a32fe564d4f7d655d1c3537fbe725]\n\n[Image: 3cb2c0c4dc7cc2db3edb4fd11072fc4f303448a212ea7f6d0c332f537f8909e8]\n\n[Image: 45c2aec41c020220be87c1b8f1e3295e6ce29f5382b8d0d55f57b289415bc488]\n\n3.2 -Biphosphonates, raloxifene, denosumab, calcitonin\n[Image: 8657759d16dfab9651e80977d2b44e2ad7a821b5dfec5ecac64823eb16197c2e]\n\n[Image: 596a90a29a5db2b7ec1d107b1589a1a88811627e6ad562b73b897c4c031bac62]\n\n[Image: f8d16c3d886672f835fb794955e8893bfc2bb54df57aac2728a71045e13fe924]\n\n[Image: 3556644d60f9c6c6ab6b035d4d18c28d36c358c13368791803f7124bfd65924a]\n\n[Image: 1bf4f3d817182bfb77ddde7e7395c6645feff1725eb40271ef402fc302c9d86d]\n\n[Image: afa82efdf34014d6035ea8a3fa31b614b7843b9bc138b58d93bdb19f13354c7c]",
